-----
  Samples/Media/Hlms/Pbs/Any/Vct_piece_ps.any        (3 sites)
  Samples/Media/VCT/LightVctBounceInject_piece_cs.any (1 site)

MEDIA ONLY. Studio stages media from the SOURCE tree (cmake/IncludeOgre.cmake), so
no C++ is recompiled — but every tree still re-runs the patch loop, and a tree
whose staged media predates this patch renders the old bias.

OVERLAP. Vct_piece_ps.any is also touched by patches 0021, 0033, 0045, 0048 and
0066; build-ogre.sh's per-patch reverse check cannot see an overlap, so a tree
that already carries those will report this one as "upstream changed the patched
file". Reset the submodule and apply the stack in order — the standing recipe.

